.TH uint64_read 3
.SH NAME
uint64_read \- read a little-endian 64-bit integer
.SH SYNTAX
.B #include "uint64.h"
.LP
uint64 \fBuint64_read\fP(const char* \fIin\fP);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B uint64_read
reads eight bytes from the memory pointed to by \fIin\fP and interprets them
as a little-endian 64-bit unsigned integer.
.SH SEE ALSO
uint64(3)